{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Astray\u00a0</strong>is a challenging (yet whimsical) puzzle-precision platformer that subtly touches on the struggle to find direction in one's life.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hesitancy to commit to a path in life has left you abandoned. Work through your indecision as you constantly transition between good and evil to find yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Game Mechanics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch:</strong>\u00a0Unique game mechanic that switches your controls each time you jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foresight: </strong>Use the game's <i>Foresight</i> mechanic to plan your route to achieve the unlikely first-try success.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:\u00a0</strong>A minimal tutorial followed by learn-as-you-fail levels that demand creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Tokens: </strong>You're an immortal soul that can survive without health, but the tokens might be useful elsewhere...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redemption Tokens: </strong>If you find yourself stuck due to an earlier misstep, use these limited tokens to restart the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodness Meter:</strong> The purity of your soul is tracked, show them (who?) that you have more than just a good heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamps: </strong>Sacrifice soul fragments to light the lamps in your path, a gift to help guide other lost souls. If you find a lamp already lit, accept the gift for a unique power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> Collect trinkets in hard-to-reach places to remind yourself who you are + alter game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets: </strong>Unexpected secrets encourage you to make choices that can alter your end-goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.poster.avif?t=1763051013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.webm?t=1763051013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.mp4?t=1763051013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You watch them ascend around you... what will you sacrifice to keep up?\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760080?t=1763051013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/2cc47161c59b0e23ec07104ba832d56ca22f1901/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763051013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/9e8d160eaa6c2084f6b8764918e516ce97b1e9e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763051013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/9e8d160eaa6c2084f6b8764918e516ce97b1e9e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763051013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3802840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >